o a single run pays for them. Camp The TRAIN door now appears after your fifth run. Before that, the only way out of camp is the road down. Speed The first tap of the speed button goes straight to x3. Tap again for x2, and again for x1. W","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T04:22:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114043647","verified_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4927270-1844751498234027","game_id":"steam-4927270","kind":"announcement","title":"DELVERS 2.12.0 — The Road Keeps Its Own Counsel","summary":"DELVERS is a game you can leave running. This patch is for the part of the game that happens while you're somewhere else: what it sells for you, what it tells you when you come back, and a quiet room to test a build before you send it down. Come tell us what's still wrong: discord.gg/4vtUcQYTD Auto-sell Choose what the road sells for you. A new toggle on the character sheet and on THE SPOILS steps through: off, commons, magic & below, rare & below. Anything below your choice is sold the moment i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T12:10:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498234027","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4927270-1842846814446859","game_id":"steam-4927270","kind":"announcement","title":"DELVERS 2.11.0 — One Damage Line","summary":"The day the forge fix went live, the player who caught it came back with three more and confirmed the forge works. This patch is those three, plus three older asks of his. Come tell us what's still wrong: https://discord.gg/4vtUcQYTD Gear reads honestly Flat damage was wildly overtuned. A rare with \"+21 damage\" out-hit a mythic eleven times over, because the number was written as if your delvers hit for 50 and they hit for 3 to 16. Flat damage now tops out at +5 and is the affix for low-base del","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T14:59:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814446859","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4927270-1842846814441678","game_id":"steam-4927270","kind":"announcement","title":"DELVERS 2.10.0 — The Anvil Answers","summary":"A bug-fix patch. The forge shipped broken and a player caught it; this fixes that and the rest of what he found. Come tell us what's still wrong: https://discord.gg/4vtUcQYTD The forge works. Clicking inside the dialog no longer closes it and drops your fuel. The first piece you feed is THE ANCHOR and sets the mythic's base, power and slot. Fed pieces stay in the grid, greyed, and a dark FORGE button now says why. Stat preview. Hover any stash piece and your delver's own numbers move, green when","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T22:45:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814441678","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4927270-1842212951297861","game_id":"steam-4927270","kind":"announcement","title":"DELVERS 2.9.0 — The Mythic Forge","summary":"Five days ago a player told us the truth: coming home to thirty legendaries isn't a hoard, it's homework. This patch is the answer — the item economy rebuilt from the ground down, and at the end of it, a forge. Come argue about builds: https://discord.gg/4vtUcQYTD Fewer, better Half the clutter. Trash foes drop far less. Bosses and apexes drop exactly what they always did — loot now concentrates on the kills that meant something. Every boss pays. A boss's first drop is now always rare or better.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T18:41:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951297861","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4927270-1841579228672398","game_id":"steam-4927270","kind":"announcement","title":"DELVERS 2.8.0 — Gold Belongs to Legends","summary":"The list keeps coming and the camp keeps listening — this whole patch is round two of SacredTie's feedback, hours after round one shipped. Come add your voice: https://discord.gg/4vtUcQYTD Gold belongs to legends The rarity ladder is now grey → blue → purple → gold. Magic gear wears blue, rare wears purple, and legendary keeps gold — alone. No more squinting at two golden borders wondering which one matters. Locks mean it A locked slot refuses every equip — even yours. No more accidental clicks ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T23:04:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228672398","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4927270-1841579228670055","game_id":"steam-4927270","kind":"announcement","title":"DELVERS 2.7.0 — The First Voice From the Dark","summary":"Days after 2.6.0, the first player walked into our Discord and left a feedback list that read like a QA report — thank you, SacredTie. Most of this patch is that list, built. The door's open: discord.gg/4vtUcQYTD. THE STASH GREW DOORS - ITEMS at camp — a new plate above the sheet button opens your stash directly. No more hunting for gear through a character page. (And it's called ITEMS now, everywhere — “the hoard” belongs to the dragons.) - Gear nobody can wear sinks to the bottom of the stash,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T20:51:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228670055","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4927270-1840944183781114","game_id":"steam-4927270","kind":"update","title":"DELVERS 2.6.0 — Your Reviews Became a Patch","summary":"Nearly everything in this patch came from your feedback — a special thanks to Tenoshii's review, which reads like a design doc. Keep it coming. Your gear is yours No more auto-equip during runs. Loot rides home in your satchel. No more surprise gear swaps, no more health bars moving on their own. THE SPOILS at camp — a plate by the fire shows everything you hauled. One tap on EQUIP UPGRADES dons the best of it. Item cards say who gear is for (\"for: LANCER · PALADIN\"), upgrades glow green in the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-15T00:33:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183781114","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4927270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:17Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:17Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4927270":"2026-10-26T15:17:17Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4927270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:17Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:17Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:17Z"},"4984880":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:17Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:17Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:17Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4927270","app_id":4927270,"app_scope":"base"